<title>MEXICO: Profin names executive. [CORRECTED 19:37 GMT].</title>
<headline>Profin names executive. [CORRECTED 19:37 GMT].</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline from &quot;names head of Banca Promex&quot;)</p>
<p>Guadalajara-based Grupo Financiero Promex-Finamex said on Monday it named Alberto Ardura Gonzalez as head of corporate banking at its banking unit, (corrects position) Banca Promex. The post was newly created.</p>
<p>Previously, Ardura Gonzalez was head of New-York based Valores Finamex International, a unit of the banking group.</p>
<p>-- Henry Tricks, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9560</p>
